# Signing material — must NEVER be committed.
#
# The Android upload-key keystore (privycs-upload.keystore) and the
# Play Store-downloaded App-Signing certificate (deployment_cert.der)
# both live in .privycs-keys/. Anything in that directory is local-
# only; CI gets the keystore via base64-encoded GitHub Secret
# (ANDROID_KEYSTORE_B64), not from this tree.
.privycs-keys/

# Defensive: catch any other key/cert material that might end up
# elsewhere in the tree by accident. *.pem covers exported public
# certs (still better not committed — they're identifiers); the
# rest are explicitly secret-bearing formats.
*.keystore
*.jks
*.der
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx

# Specifically the Play Console "Download deployment_cert" file —
# regardless of where saved.
deployment_cert*

# ── Local / internal files — never publish ───────────────────────
# AI-assistant working notes and internal planning docs: local-only.
CLAUDE.md
OPEN_TEST_BLOCKERS_PLAN.md

# Stray debug / log dumps.
debug.txt
*.log

# ── Build outputs ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Release artifacts are produced by CI and attached to GitHub
# Releases — they are never committed to the source tree.
*.apk
*.aab

# ── OS / editor cruft ────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.bak
*.orig
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# ── Play Store listing assets — local-only ───────────────────────
# Store icons + listing screenshots. The screenshots here are the
# UN-blurred originals (real server hostnames / IP addresses); the
# blurred, repo-safe versions live in screenshots/.
android/play-store/


# iOS — pre-fetched + locally-patched WireGuardKit SPM dep, built by CI
ios/.deps/
ios/ThirdParty/AmneziaWG/

# ── Stray working assets (repo-root scratch) ─────────────────────
# Loose AmneziaWG icon SVGs dropped in the repo root + an ad-hoc
# screenshot grab. The intentional, repo-safe (blurred) screenshots
# under screenshots/ stay tracked — only this stray grab is ignored.
/awg_on.svg
/awg_off.svg
/screenshots/screen.png

# Smart Decision Engine gomobile artefacts (rebuilt in CI)
android/app/libs/engine.aar
ios/ThirdParty/Engine/Engine.xcframework/

# Website-only design-system bundles dropped at repo root (not app source).
*.zip
